<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK INCREASES LOSS IN MAY.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK INCREASES LOSS IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.65 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.65 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.40 vs   0.22</p>
